{1}{Rest in Peace}{Rest in Peace}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Beloved Mother}{Beloved Mother}{}{}{}{}
{3}{Earth this casket keeps, and the sunbeams long to linger, where our sainted baby sleeps}{Earth this casket keeps, and the sunbeams long to linger, where our sainted baby sleeps}{}{}{}{}
{4}{Here lies an Atheist * All dressed up * And no place to go}{Here lies an Atheist * All dressed up * And no place to go}{}{}{}{}
{5}{This spot is the sweetest I've seen in my life * For it raises my flowers and covers my wife}{This spot is the sweetest I've seen in my life * For it raises my flowers and covers my wife}{}{}{}{}
{6}{Here lies a man who died * Nobody mourned * Nobody cried * How he lived * How he fared * Nobody knows * Nobody cared}{Here lies a man who died * Nobody mourned * Nobody cried * How he lived * How he fared * Nobody knows * Nobody cared}{}{}{}{}
{7}{Grim death took him * Without any warning * Well at night * Dead in the morning}{Grim death took him * Without any warning * Well at night * Dead in the morning}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Eat, Drink and Be Merry * For Tomorrow You May Die}{Eat, Drink and Be Merry * For Tomorrow You May Die}{}{}{}{}
{9}{Quoth the Raven, Nevermore}{Quoth the Raven, Nevermore}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Here lies my love, Here lies my heart}{Here lies my love, Here lies my heart}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Beloved Father}{Beloved Father}{}{}{}{}
{12}{I told you I was sick!}{I told you I was sick!}{}{}{}{}
{13}{Sleep with Angels Evermore}{Sleep with Angels Evermore}{}{}{}{}
{14}{Hey!  Who blew out the candle? * Hello...  Is anyone there?}{Hey!  Who blew out the candle? * Hello...  Is anyone there?}{}{}{}{}
{15}{Weep not father and mother for me, for I am waiting in glory for thee.}{Weep not father and mother for me, for I am waiting in glory for thee.}{}{}{}{}
{16}{Precious love * Precious one * We will meet again * To be as one}{Precious love * Precious one * We will meet again * To be as one}{}{}{}{}
{17}{I came here to die * Not to make a speech!}{I came here to die * Not to make a speech!}{}{}{}{}
{18}{A precious one from me has gone * I am left alone to carry on}{A precious one from me has gone * I am left alone to carry on}{}{}{}{}
{19}{We must all die * there is no doubt * Your glass is running...  mine is out}{We must all die * there is no doubt * Your glass is running...  mine is out}{}{}{}{}
{20}{Nothing is so sacred as honor * Nothing is so loyal as love}{Nothing is so sacred as honor * Nothing is so loyal as love}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Many a heart by sorrow pressed * Doth envy me my peaceful rest}{Many a heart by sorrow pressed * Doth envy me my peaceful rest}{}{}{}{}
{22}{Nary a drop * Nary a one * Dead anyway * Because of a gun}{Nary a drop * Nary a one * Dead anyway * Because of a gun}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Life is a jest * All things show it * I thought so once * Now I know it}{Life is a jest * All things show it * I thought so once * Now I know it}{}{}{}{}
{24}{Sometimes, there is no poison like love}{Sometimes, there is no poison like love}{}{}{}{}
{25}{Love is your spirit in the sun * Strength is your legacy you left * Life is your essence never gone}{Love is your spirit in the sun * Strength is your legacy you left * Life is your essence never gone}{}{}{}{}
{26}{This old world is made brighter * By the lives of folks like you}{This old world is made brighter * By the lives of folks like you}{}{}{}{}
{27}{Step softly * A dream lies here}{Step softly * A dream lies here}{}{}{}{}
{28}{So much to do * So little done}{So much to do * So little done}{}{}{}{}
{29}{Sleep on sweet baby, and take thy rest * God called thee home, He thought it best}{Sleep on sweet baby, and take thy rest * God called thee home, He thought it best}{}{}{}{}
{30}{Learn the living from the dead * How easy breaks life's tender thread}{Learn the living from the dead * How easy breaks life's tender thread}{}{}{}{}
{31}{Poems and Epitaphs are but stuff * Here lies Zed Blacksword * That's Enough}{Poems and Epitaphs are but stuff * Here lies Zed Blacksword * That's Enough}{}{}{}{}
{32}{This tombstone is a Milestone * Hah! how so? * Because beneath lies MILES * who's MILES below}{This tombstone is a Milestone * Hah! how so? * Because beneath lies MILES * who's MILES below}{}{}{}{}
{33}{*Carrie McGee*  Old man McGee wanted to marry...  So the devil sent him Carrie.}{*Carrie McGee*  Old man McGee wanted to marry...  So the devil sent him Carrie.}{}{}{}{}
{34}{*Owin Moore*  Gone away, Owing more, than he could pay.}{*Owin Moore*  Gone away, Owing more, than he could pay.}{}{}{}{}
